    {
      "id": "el-1055",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -191.89174392095606,
      "y": 622.5273225534954,
      "width": 1168.251953125,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1055,
      "version": 178,
      "versionNonce": 45190927,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784825277024,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Entra-only auth — no API keys, no Semantic Kernel, no offline fallback path for agent behavior\n• Schema validation on every agent response (contracts.py) — hard-fail on ValidationError\n• Ruff lint + pytest regression gates in CI\n• PipelineEvent observability stream (agents/events.py, pipeline.py) — stage_start / stage_end / stage_error / tool_call\n• Foundry + Fabric wrapping stays behind adapters so Foundry Hosted Agent deployment can be added without rebinding core logic",
      "originalText": "• Entra-only auth — no API keys, no Semantic Kernel, no offline fallback path for agent behavior\n• Schema validation on every agent response (contracts.py) — hard-fail on ValidationError\n• Ruff lint + pytest regression gates in CI\n• PipelineEvent observability stream (agents/events.py, pipeline.py) — stage_start / stage_end / stage_error / tool_call\n• Foundry + Fabric wrapping stays behind adapters so Foundry Hosted Agent deployment can be added without rebinding core logic",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 11,
      "index": "as",
      "autoResize": true
    },
